            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mukti is a first-person narrative adventure set within the immersive environment of an Indian museum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blurring the lines between game and cinema, Mukti delves deeply into a critical social issue that demands our attention: human trafficking.  Through rich storytelling and immersive gameplay mechanics, Mukti invites players to confront the realities faced by victims and survivors alike, shedding light on this pressing global issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>PlayStation-Backed Indian Gaming Studio Casts Film Stars for Narrative Adventure ‘Mukti’</i>&quot; - Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>A journey of discovery, redemption, and the impact of hidden narratives.</i>&quot; - PlayStation Blog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Mukti game puts Indian stories on the world stage with gripping new trailer</i><strong>&quot; - </strong>PCQuest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Why Mukti Could Be the ‘Gone Home’ of Indian Gaming</i><strong>&quot; -</strong> The Quest unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Sony's PS5 Indie Program Might Have Found Another Winner</i>&quot; - Push Square</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>‘Mukti’ Brings India to the Forefront of the Adventure Genre in a Stunning New First-Person Title</i>&quot; - VICE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching on PlayStation 5 and PC, Mukti offers an impactful gaming experience that enlightens and empowers. Join us on this transformative journey to make a difference.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mukti is a first-person narrative adventure set within the immersive environment of an Indian museum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blurring the lines between game and cinema, Mukti delves deeply into a critical social issue that demands our attention: human trafficking.  Through rich storytelling and immersive gameplay mechanics, Mukti invites players to confront the realities faced by victims and survivors alike, shedding light on this pressing global issue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>PlayStation-Backed Indian Gaming Studio Casts Film Stars for Narrative Adventure ‘Mukti’</i>&quot; - Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>A journey of discovery, redemption, and the impact of hidden narratives.</i>&quot; - PlayStation Blog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Mukti game puts Indian stories on the world stage with gripping new trailer</i><strong>&quot; - </strong>PCQuest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Why Mukti Could Be the ‘Gone Home’ of Indian Gaming</i><strong>&quot; -</strong> The Quest unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Sony's PS5 Indie Program Might Have Found Another Winner</i>&quot; - Push Square</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>‘Mukti’ Brings India to the Forefront of the Adventure Genre in a Stunning New First-Person Title</i>&quot; - VICE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching on PlayStation 5 and PC, Mukti offers an impactful gaming experience that enlightens and empowers. Join us on this transformative journey to make a difference.</p>",
